    "title": "Reusable Bamboo Kitchen Towel Pink - 20 Sheets",
    "body_html": "<p data-start=\"213\" data-end=\"488\">Upgrade your kitchen with the <strong data-start=\"243\" data-end=\"288\">Beco Bamboo Reusable Kitchen Towel</strong>— the smarter, sustainable alternative to disposable paper towels. Made from premium bamboo fibers, this <strong data-start=\"394\" data-end=\"418\">bamboo kitchen towel</strong> is designed to be ultra-durable, highly absorbent, and eco-conscious.</p>\n<p data-start=\"490\" data-end=\"757\">If you’re looking for the <strong data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"538\">best kitchen towel</strong> that combines performance with sustainability, this is your solution. Each sheet in this <strong data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"659\">reusable kitchen towel roll</strong> can be washed and reused multiple times, helping you reduce waste and save money in the long run.</p>\n<p data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"1068\">These <strong data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"793\">absorbent kitchen towels</strong> effortlessly handle spills, grease, and daily messes, making them ideal as <strong data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"896\">kitchen cleaning towels</strong>, <strong data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"921\">kitchen dish towels</strong>, or even quick countertop wipes. Unlike traditional paper towels, this <strong data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1026\">bamboo reusable kitchen towel</strong> is strong when wet and soft to the touch.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1340\">Crafted from sustainable bamboo, it functions as an <strong data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1152\">eco friendly kitchen towel</strong> and a reliable <strong data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1191\">bamboo kitchen roll</strong> for conscious households. If you want to <strong data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1254\">buy kitchen towel</strong> products that are reusable, durable, and planet-friendly, this is the perfect choice.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1572\">Though the initial <strong data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1384\">kitchen towel price</strong> may seem higher than disposable options, the long-term savings make it a cost-effective investment. Replace single-use paper towels with <strong data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1548\">organic kitchen towels</strong> that are built to last.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1671\">Switch to <strong data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1618\">bamboo reusable kitchen towels</strong> and make your kitchen smarter, cleaner, and greener.<span data-sheets-root=\"1\" data-sheets-value='{\"1\":2,\"2\":\"\\n100% Bamboo Rayon\\nYou can use the sheet, wash it, and reuse it again upto 100 times!\\nSuper absorbent than your regular paper tissue\\nCan be used for multiple surfaces like marble, veneer, wood, glass, metal \\nIt’s hand and machine washable\\nStrong and durable single-ply bamboo sheets that are lint-free\\nThis pack contains 1 Roll with 20 sheets.\\n\\nWe could go on but do you really need more?\\n\\n\"}' data-sheets-userformat='{\"2\":9153,\"3\":{\"1\":0},\"9\":1,\"10\":1,\"11\":4,\"12\":0,\"16\":8}' data-sheets-formula=\"=vlookup(R[0]C[-8],'Content - J'!C[-8]:C[-2],5,0)\"><br></span></p>\n<p><!----></p>",
